    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "97876cc0cc8749c6bd822b6399dcbc70",
    "m_Title": "Replace Sine Time",
    "m_Content": "Instead of this 0-1 value that is tied to time with a sine function,\nWe can use any kind of scripting algorithms to pass some 0-1 value.\n\nOf course it should be controlled by the thumbstick,\nbut the interference/friction can be noise or some kind of glitch-generating offset driven by an algorithm.",
